# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Folio-specific: exported output files you generate while testing the
# compiler (PDFs/PNGs/SVGs produced from .folio sources). Keep .folio
# source files tracked; don't track their generated exports.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.png
*.svg
!/examples/**/*.svg